  evidence:
    title: Margin Notes / Evidence case
    question: Which explanation fits all three signed records?
    clueNodes:
    - n22
    - n9
    - n19
    clues:
    - The outage log records failure at 03:12.
    - The insurer approved a denial at 02:50 using the same event number.
    - A vendor receipt binds both records to a token issued the previous evening.
    answers:
    - id: accident
      title: The records disagree because of an ordinary clerical error.
      feedback: A clerical error does not explain the matching signed authorizations and their order.
      correct: 0
    - id: insider
      title: A lone outsider forged every record after the event.
      feedback: The independent receipt and earlier signatures rule out a single later forgery.
      correct: 0
    - id: rehearsal
      title: The outage and its denial were planned together.
      feedback: Compensation was denied before the emergencies occurred.
      correct: 1
  revelation: Compensation was denied before the emergencies occurred.
