    contract: Margin Notes
    text: 'RHEA / public archivist: Reconcile an insurance index with the original outage log. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before.'
  - id: margin-notes/1
    title: Margin Notes / Custody note
